{"id":"vd-a1-grandpas-new-phone","level":"a1","n":13,"title":{"en":"First, Touch the Camera","vi":"Đầu tiên, ông chạm vào máy ảnh"},"summary":"Zoe dạy ông Joe từng bước chụp ảnh con mèo Bella và gửi cho cả nhà — nhưng ông bấm hơi nhiều lần.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-grandpas-new-phone","level":"a1","title":{"en":"Grandpa's New Phone","vi":"Chiếc điện thoại mới của ông"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[{"id":"phone","x":800}]},"cast":{"zoe":{"name":{"en":"Zoe","vi":"Zoe"},"look":"teengirl","x":520,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#3A2A22","top":"#8C7BC2","topShade":"#7666AD","skin":"#E9B896","skinShade":"#D49E7A"}},"joe":{"name":{"en":"Grandpa Joe","vi":"Ông Joe"},"look":"grandpa","x":1100,"style":{"glasses":true}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"joe","en":"Zoe, I want a photo of Bella.","vi":"Zoe ơi, ông muốn chụp một tấm ảnh con Bella.","ipa":["ˈzoʊi","aɪ","wɑnt","ə","ˈfoʊˌtoʊ","ʌv","ˈbɛlə"],"start":0.554,"end":3.084,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.488],[2,1.644],[3,1.942],[4,2.056],[5,2.439],[6,2.624]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"OK, Grandpa. First, touch the camera here.","vi":"Vâng ạ. Đầu tiên, ông chạm vào máy ảnh ở đây.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","fɝst","tʌtʃ","ðə","ˈkæmɚə","hiɹ"],"start":3.874,"end":6.954,"gesture":"explain","prop":"phone","timing":[[0,3.874],[1,4.119],[2,5.241],[3,5.596],[4,5.909],[5,6.037],[6,6.491]]},{"speaker":"joe","en":"This one? The little black camera?","vi":"Cái này à? Cái máy ảnh nhỏ màu đen này à?","ipa":["ðɪs","wʌn","ðə","ˈlɪtəl","blæk","ˈkæmɚə"],"start":7.744,"end":10.634,"expression":"thinking","gesture":"point","prop":"phone","timing":[[0,7.744],[1,7.959],[2,9.105],[3,9.347],[4,9.645],[5,9.986]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Yes! Then look at the screen.","vi":"Đúng rồi ạ! Rồi ông nhìn vào màn hình.","ipa":["jɛs","ðɛn","lʊk","æt","ðə","skɹin"],"start":11.424,"end":13.584,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,11.424],[1,12.247],[2,12.46],[3,12.702],[4,12.815],[5,12.915]]},{"speaker":"joe","en":"I can see Bella! She is on the sofa.","vi":"Ông thấy con Bella rồi! Nó đang nằm trên ghế sofa.","ipa":["aɪ","kæn","si","ˈbɛlə","ʃi","ɪz","ɑn","ðə","ˈsoʊfə"],"start":14.374,"end":17.714,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,14.374],[1,14.522],[2,14.806],[3,15.062],[4,16.35],[5,16.663],[6,16.833],[7,16.961],[8,17.103]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Good. Now press the big white circle.","vi":"Giỏi quá. Giờ ông bấm vào vòng tròn to màu trắng.","ipa":["ɡʊd","naʊ","pɹɛs","ðə","bɪɡ","waɪt","ˈsɝkəl"],"start":18.504,"end":21.114,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,18.504],[1,19.259],[2,19.5],[3,19.87],[4,20.012],[5,20.253],[6,20.523]]},{"speaker":"joe","en":"Like this?","vi":"Thế này à?","ipa":["laɪk","ðɪs"],"start":21.904,"end":22.544,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,21.904],[1,22.166]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Yes! Now you have a photo.","vi":"Đúng rồi ạ! Giờ ông có ảnh rồi đấy.","ipa":["jɛs","naʊ","ju","hæv","ə","ˈfoʊˌtoʊ"],"start":23.334,"end":25.314,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,23.334],[1,24.143],[2,24.271],[3,24.399],[4,24.583],[5,24.697]]},{"speaker":"joe","en":"Wonderful! How do I send it to the family?","vi":"Tuyệt quá! Làm sao để ông gửi cho cả nhà?","ipa":["ˈwʌndɚfəl","haʊ","du","aɪ","sɛnd","ɪt","tu","ðə","ˈfæməli"],"start":26.104,"end":29.544,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,26.104],[1,27.593],[2,27.834],[3,28.005],[4,28.147],[5,28.488],[6,28.616],[7,28.758],[8,28.914]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Touch the photo, then touch \"Send.\"","vi":"Ông chạm vào tấm ảnh, rồi chạm vào chữ \"Send\".","ipa":["tʌtʃ","ðə","ˈfoʊˌtoʊ","ðɛn","tʌtʃ","sɛnd"],"start":30.334,"end":32.374,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,30.334],[1,30.606],[2,30.762],[3,31.231],[4,31.458],[5,31.828]]},{"speaker":"joe","en":"Send, send, send…","vi":"Gửi, gửi, gửi…","ipa":["sɛnd","sɛnd","sɛnd"],"start":33.164,"end":34.964,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,33.164],[1,33.899],[2,34.453]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Grandpa, stop! Don't press it again!","vi":"Ông ơi, dừng lại! Ông đừng bấm nữa!","ipa":["ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","stɑp","doʊnt","pɹɛs","ɪt","əˈɡɛn"],"start":35.754,"end":38.494,"expression":"surprised","thoughtBubble":"message:20","timing":[[0,35.754],[1,36.239],[2,37.248],[3,37.503],[4,37.83],[5,37.958]]},{"speaker":"joe","en":"Oh. How many photos did I send?","vi":"Ơ. Ông gửi mấy tấm rồi?","ipa":["oʊ","haʊ","ˈmɛni","ˈfoʊˌtoʊz","dɪd","aɪ","sɛnd"],"start":39.284,"end":42.464,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,39.284],[1,40.546],[2,40.801],[3,41.057],[4,41.568],[5,41.782],[6,41.938]]},{"speaker":"zoe","en":"Twenty, Grandpa. Twenty photos of Bella!","vi":"Hai mươi tấm ạ. Hai mươi tấm ảnh con Bella!","ipa":["ˈtwɛnti","ˈɡɹændˌpɑ","ˈtwɛnti","ˈfoʊˌtoʊz","ʌv","ˈbɛlə"],"start":43.254,"end":46.304,"expression":"happy","react":{"joe":"shy"},"timing":[[0,43.254],[1,43.593],[2,44.743],[3,45.113],[4,45.624],[5,45.794]]}],"words":[{"id":"camera","en":"camera","ipa":"ˈkæmɚə","vi":"máy ảnh; máy quay","level":0},{"id":"photo","en":"photo","ipa":"ˈfoʊˌtoʊ","vi":"ảnh; bức ảnh","level":0},{"id":"send","en":"send","ipa":"sɛnd","vi":"gửi; gửi đi; phái đi","level":1},{"id":"touch","en":"touch","ipa":"tʌtʃ","vi":"chạm, sờ; xúc giác; sự đụng chạm","level":0},{"id":"family","en":"family","ipa":"ˈfæməli","vi":"gia đình; họ (sinh vật)","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Hướng dẫn từng bước","pattern":"First, … · Then … · Now … · Don't … · Press / Touch …","explain":"Hướng dẫn ai làm gì dùng động từ nguyên thể đứng đầu câu (câu mệnh lệnh): \"Touch the camera.\" Nối các bước bằng \"First → Then → Now\". Muốn bảo đừng làm thì thêm \"Don't\" ở đầu.","keys":["first","then","now","don't"],"lines":[1,3,5,7,9,11]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a1-grandpas-new-phone.mp3","v":"a62ea2bff8","duration":47.4,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}